# Tai lieu tong hop tinh nang project Dashboard

Ngay tong hop: 2026-04-02

Pham vi doc va tong hop:
- Da doc toan bo ma nguon ung dung first-party trong `c:\xampp\htdocs\dashboard`.
- Khong phan tich chi tiet `vendor/`, chi ghi nhan thu vien phu thuoc va vai tro.
- Cac file backup nhu `VB_IOT/vb_iot_tmp_backup.php` va `USER-SYSTEM/user_system.php.bak-20260323-vi` khong phai diem vao chinh, chi la ban luu.

## 1. Tong quan project

Day la mot dashboard PHP chay tren XAMPP, su dung:
- MySQL nguon de doc du lieu van ban va mot so bang he thong.
- MySQL local de luu kho luu tru van ban phan loai.
- Oracle de lay bao cao DGX va du lieu tong hop du no.
- `PhpSpreadsheet` de xuat Excel cho module DGX.

Project co 4 module nghiep vu chinh duoc mo ben trong `iframe` tu `index.php`:
- `VB_IOT`: danh sach van ban, doc van ban, danh dau da doc, luu tru local.
- `DGX`: tong hop diem giao dich xa, bao cao DGX, danh sach diem co dinh, xuat Excel.
- `HOME_PAGE`: dashboard tong hop du no theo POS / Xa va nguon von.
- `USER-SYSTEM`: quan ly can bo, loc danh sach, xem chi tiet, them moi, cap nhat.

Ngoai 4 module tren, project con co:
- Lop ket noi DB dung chung trong `DB/connect_DB.php`.
- Cac endpoint CSS trong thu muc `view/`.
- Script Oracle trong `CODE-ORCALE_SQL/`.
- Rewrite URL trong `.htaccess`.

## 2. Cau truc thu muc va vai tro

- `index.php`
  Trang shell cua toan dashboard. Chiu trach nhiem hien menu trai, mo module trong `iframe`, va cap nhat badge van ban chua doc.

- `DB/connect_DB.php`
  Lop ket noi MySQL/Oracle dung chung. Co fallback MySQL source -> local, co guard chan lenh ghi vao host nhay cam.

- `VB_IOT/`
  Module van ban. Gom trang danh sach, SQL helper, endpoint xem file, va file backup.

- `DGX/`
  Module DGX. Gom trang chinh, SQL helper, layout popup bao cao, ghi chu module.

- `HOME_PAGE/`
  Module dashboard tong hop du no. Gom trang chinh, SQL helper, ghi chu module.

- `USER-SYSTEM/`
  Module quan ly can bo. Gom trang danh sach/chinh sua, trang them moi, SQL helper, ghi chu module.

- `view/`
  Cac endpoint CSS dong cho shell va tung module:
  - `style_Das.php`
  - `Styple_vb_iot.php`
  - `Style_dgx.php`
  - `Style_home_page.php`
  - `Style_user_system.php`

- `CODE-ORCALE_SQL/`
  Chua thu tuc Oracle `CODE.SQL`, ghi chu encoding, va mot truy van mau `KT740.txt`.

- `composer.json`, `composer.lock`, `vendor/`
  Quan ly thu vien PHP. Hien tai project dung `phpoffice/phpspreadsheet`.

- `index.html`
  Redirect client-side sang `index.php`.

- `.htaccess`
  Rewrite pretty URL cho xem file PDF va map `index.html` -> `index.php`.

## 3. Luong chay tong the

1. Nguoi dung vao `index.php`.
2. `index.php` khoi tao session va tinh so van ban chua doc dua tren `$_SESSION['read_docs']`.
3. Khi bam icon ben trai, dashboard mo module tuong ung trong `iframe`.
4. Moi module tu tai du lieu tu MySQL hoac Oracle.
5. Rieng `VB_IOT` co co che postMessage de bao `index.php` cap nhat badge chua doc sau khi mo van ban.

## 4. Tinh nang theo tung module

### 4.1. Dashboard shell (`index.php`)

Tinh nang:
- Hien sidebar chua 4 icon chuc nang: Van ban, DGX, Tong hop du no, Quan ly user.
- Hien placeholder khi chua mo module.
- Mo noi dung module ben trong `iframe`.
- Tinh va cap nhat so van ban chua doc.
- Co API nho `index.php?api=unread_count` tra ve JSON:
  - `ok`
  - `unread`
  - `total`

Bang/du lieu lien quan:
- `eoffice_approval`
- `eoffice_approval_file`
- `$_SESSION['read_docs']`

Ham/JS can nam:
- `openDocs()`: mo `VB_IOT/vb_iot.php`.
- `openDgx()`: mo `DGX/dgx.php`.
- `openHomePage()`: mo `HOME_PAGE/home_page.php`.
- `openUserSystem()`: mo `USER-SYSTEM/user_system.php`.
- `goHome(e)`: dong `iframe`, quay ve placeholder.
- `setUnreadBadge(value)`: cap nhat badge.
- `refreshUnreadBadge()`: goi API unread_count va dong bo badge.

### 4.2. Module VB_IOT (`VB_IOT/vb_iot.php`, `VB_IOT/vb_iot_sql.php`, `VB_IOT/view_file.php`)

Muc dich:
- Doc danh sach van ban tu he thong nguon.
- Tim kiem va loc theo thoi gian.
- Danh dau da doc/chua doc theo session.
- Xem danh sach nguoi nhan van ban.
- Mo file van ban inline.
- Luu file van ban sang kho local theo phan loai.
- Xem danh sach file da luu trong kho local.

Tinh nang nguoi dung:
- Tim theo tieu de hoac ky hieu van ban.
- Tim theo ma so van ban (`doc_no`).
- Loc ngay theo 4 che do:
  - Khoang ngay (`range`)
  - Theo nam (`year`)
  - Theo thang (`month`)
  - Tat ca (`all`)
- Danh dau da doc trang hien tai.
- Danh dau da doc tat ca cac trang theo dieu kien loc.
- Reset da doc cho trang hien tai.
- Loc nhanh trong bang hien tai bang JavaScript.
- Mo popup nguoi nhan.
- Mo popup luu tru local.
- Mo popup danh sach luu tru local theo phan loai.

API/action backend:
- `?api=archive_types`
  Doc danh sach phan loai tu bang `classify` trong local DB.
- `?api=archive_save` (POST)
  Lay file tu MySQL nguon va luu vao local DB `save_eoffice`.
- `?api=archive_list&maPl=...`
  Tra ve danh sach file da luu theo ma phan loai.
- `?api=archive_raw&maso=...&maPl=...`
  Xuat file raw tu local DB de xem/truyen file inline.
- `mark_all_read=1`
  Danh dau da doc toan bo dong trong trang hien tai.
- `mark_all_pages_read=1`
  Danh dau da doc toan bo dong o tat ca trang theo bo loc.
- `reset_read=1`
  Xoa trang thai da doc cua trang hien tai.

Bang du lieu phu thuoc:
- MySQL nguon:
  - `eoffice_approval`
  - `eoffice_approval_file`
  - `eoffice_approval_receiver`
  - `user`
- MySQL local (`dashboard_my`):
  - `classify`
  - `save_eoffice`

Co che quan trong:
- Tu dong tao local DB `dashboard_my` neu chua ton tai.
- Tang `max_allowed_packet` phien local de luu BLOB lon.
- Dung `GET_LOCK/RELEASE_LOCK` de tranh 2 request cung luu 1 file.
- Ghi BLOB theo chunk bang `append_blob_chunks()` de giam loi packet.
- Giu trang thai da doc trong session 30 ngay.
- Giu `index_return_url` de quay lai dung danh sach sau khi mo van ban.

Ham backend can nam trong `VB_IOT/vb_iot.php`:
- `normalize_date_input()`: chuan hoa ngay vao.
- `json_exit()`: tra JSON va ket thuc request.
- `open_local_dashboard_conn()`: mo ket noi local DB, co the tao DB neu thieu.
- `fetch_archive_types()`: doc danh sach phan loai.
- `append_blob_chunks()`: ghi BLOB vao `save_eoffice` theo chunk.
- `archive_lock_name()`: tao ten lock theo `maSo + maPl`.
- `acquire_archive_lock()`: xin lock MySQL.
- `release_archive_lock()`: nhat lock MySQL.

Ham SQL can nam trong `VB_IOT/vb_iot_sql.php`:
- `vb_iot_year_options_sql()`: lay nam co du lieu.
- `vb_iot_mark_page_sql()`: lay danh sach `maso` cua 1 trang.
- `vb_iot_mark_all_pages_sql()`: lay danh sach `maso` cua tat ca trang.
- `vb_iot_count_sql()`: dem tong so van ban theo bo loc.
- `vb_iot_list_sql()`: lay danh sach van ban theo bo loc + paging.
- `vb_iot_receiver_sql()`: lay danh sach nguoi nhan.
- `vb_iot_read_filter_sql()`: dem so van ban da doc trong bo loc hien tai.
- `vb_iot_source_file_sql()`: lay file goc de luu local.
- `vb_iot_archive_exists_sql()`: kiem tra ban ghi local theo khoa.
- `vb_iot_archive_delete_by_key_sql()`: xoa ban ghi trung truoc khi luu lai.
- `vb_iot_archive_update_sql()`: cap nhat ban ghi local.
- `vb_iot_archive_insert_sql()`: insert ban ghi local.
- `vb_iot_archive_list_sql()`: liet ke file local theo phan loai.
- `vb_iot_archive_raw_sql()`: lay noi dung file local.

Ham backend can nam trong `VB_IOT/view_file.php`:
- `normalize_mime()`: suy ra MIME type hop le.
- `build_display_title()`: tao ten hien thi/file name an toan.

Ham frontend noi bat:
- `toggleDateFilters()`: an/hien bo loc ngay/nam/thang.
- `applyQuickFilter()`: loc nhanh trong bang van ban.
- `openOverlay(docId, docSymbol)` o popup nguoi nhan: mo danh sach nguoi nhan.
- `loadTypes(selectedValue)`: tai danh sach phan loai local.
- `saveArchive()`: gui request luu van ban vao local.
- `loadArchiveList()`: tai danh sach file da luu theo phan loai.
- `applyArchiveQuickFilter()`: loc nhanh trong danh sach luu tru.
- `startDrag() / onDragMove() / stopDrag()`: keo-tha popup luu tru.

### 4.3. Module DGX (`DGX/dgx.php`, `DGX/dgx_sql.php`, `DGX/dgx_report_layout.php`)

Muc dich:
- Xem danh sach diem giao dich xa da dong bo.
- Loc nhanh theo ma PGD, ten POS, ma DGX, ten diem, ngay.
- Xem danh sach diem co dinh.
- Xem bao cao DGX theo ngay va ma DGX.
- Xem bao cao theo yeu cau theo khoang ngay va danh sach POS.
- Xuat 2 loai Excel.

Tinh nang nguoi dung:
- Tim kiem tren danh sach DGX chinh.
- Loc nhanh trong trang bang client-side.
- Popup `Danh sach diem co dinh`.
- Popup `Bao cao theo DGX`.
- Popup `Bao cao theo yeu cau`.
- Xuat Excel cho bao cao theo DGX.
- Xuat Excel cho bao cao theo yeu cau.

API backend:
- `?api=fixed_points`
  Tra danh sach diem co dinh theo ngay/toan bo va tu khoa.
- `?api=fixed_dates`
  Tra danh sach ngay GDX kha dung.
- `?api=report_list`
  Tra du lieu bao cao DGX theo ngay va ma DGX.
- `?api=report_excel`
  Xuat Excel cho bao cao DGX.
- `?api=custom_report_list`
  Tra du lieu bao cao theo yeu cau.
- `?api=custom_report_excel`
  Xuat Excel cho bao cao theo yeu cau.

Bang/view Oracle phu thuoc chinh:
- `SYNC_CONTROL`
- `TRANSPOINT_SUBCOMMUNE_MAPPING`
- `DMPOS`
- `OFL_GDTN`
- `OFL_TKTO`
- `OFL_GDTG`
- `OFL_TIDE_BOOKING`
- `OFL_TIDE_WITHDRAWAL`
- `OFL_GDGN`
- `dm_dia_phuong_dgd`
- `CHUAN_HOA_TK_INTELLECT`

Co che quan trong:
- Giai phong session som bang `session_write_close()` de request Oracle dai khong khoa tab khac.
- `normalize_pos_codes_input()` tu dong them so `0` ben trai cho ma POS ngan hon 6 ky tu.
- `get_missing_dgx_codes()` kiem tra ma DGX chua dong bo truoc khi report.
- `get_custom_report_rows()` truy van theo tung ngay trong khoang de giam timeout Oracle.
- Tang OCI call timeout rieng cho custom report.
- Dung `PhpSpreadsheet` de tao file Excel font `Times New Roman`.

Ham backend can nam trong `DGX/dgx.php`:
- `normalize_date_input()`: chuan hoa ngay.
- `normalize_dgx_codes_input()`: chuan hoa danh sach ma DGX.
- `normalize_excel_number()`: ep kieu so cho Excel.
- `is_fast_dgx_keyword()`: nhan dien tu khoa tim nhanh theo ma DGX.
- `oci_run_query()`: wrapper chay query Oracle va bind tham so.
- `get_missing_dgx_codes()`: tim ma DGX khong co du lieu trong ngay.
- `normalize_pos_codes_input()`: chuan hoa danh sach POS.
- `spreadsheet_library_available()`: kiem tra co `PhpSpreadsheet`.
- `dgx_set_call_timeout()`: set timeout OCI.
- `dgx_refresh_time_limit()`: reset `set_time_limit`.
- `dgx_json_encode_payload()`: JSON an toan voi UTF-8 loi.
- `dgx_send_json_response()`: tra JSON API.
- `build_custom_report_timeout_message()`: tao thong diep timeout ro nghia vu.
- `get_custom_report_rows()`: lay du lieu custom report theo tung ngay.
- `build_custom_report_excel_filename()`: tao ten file xuat.

Ham SQL can nam trong `DGX/dgx_sql.php`:
- `dgx_fixed_points_sql()`: query danh sach diem co dinh.
- `dgx_fixed_dates_sql()`: query danh sach ngay GDX kha dung.
- `dgx_base_sql()`: query nen cua danh sach DGX chinh.
- `dgx_report_sql()`: query bao cao DGX theo ngay.
- `dgx_missing_codes_sql()`: kiem tra ma DGX thieu dong bo.
- `dgx_custom_report_sql()`: query bao cao DGX theo khoang ngay/POS.

Ham frontend noi bat trong `DGX/dgx.php`:
- `parseQuickTokens()`: tach token loc nhanh trong bang chinh.
- `loadFixedDates()`: nap ngay cho popup diem co dinh.
- `loadFixedList()`: nap danh sach diem co dinh.

Ham frontend noi bat trong `DGX/dgx_report_layout.php`:
- `extractResponseMessage()`: doc thong diep loi thuc te tu response.
- `readJsonResponse()`: parse JSON an toan.
- `normalizeCodeTokens()`: chuan hoa ma DGX nhap tay.
- `normalizePosTokens()`: chuan hoa ma POS nhap tay.
- `initDraggableOverlay()`: khoi tao popup keo-tha.
- `loadReportList()`: tai bao cao DGX.
- `exportReportExcel()`: xuat Excel bao cao DGX.
- `loadCustomReport()`: tai bao cao theo yeu cau.
- `exportCustomReport()`: xuat Excel bao cao theo yeu cau.
- `validateFilters()`: kiem tra bo loc custom report.

### 4.4. Module HOME_PAGE (`HOME_PAGE/home_page.php`, `HOME_PAGE/home_page_sql.php`)

Muc dich:
- Hien dashboard tong hop du no theo POS / Xa.
- Tong hop theo nguon von `ALL`, `TW`, `DP`.
- Hien the so lieu tong hop.
- Hien donut chart theo chuong trinh vay.
- Hien danh sach tong hop theo POS va theo Xa.
- Hien modal chi tiet theo chuong trinh vay khi click vao tung dong.

Tinh nang nguoi dung:
- Chon ngay bao cao.
- Nhap `MAPOS`, mac dinh `3400`.
- Chuyen bo loc nguon von bang toolbar chip.
- Tai lai du lieu bang AJAX.
- Xem top chuong trinh vay bang donut chart.
- Click tung POS/Xa de mo modal chi tiet.

API backend:
- `?api=data`
  Tra ve JSON du lieu tong hop de frontend ve lai toan bo dashboard.

Bang/view Oracle phu thuoc chinh:
- `HSCV_DAILY`
- `DMPOS`
- `DMXA`
- `DM_SCHEME`

Du lieu JSON tra ve tu API:
- `totals`
- `source_totals`
- `top_scheme`
- `pos_list`
- `xa_list`
- `details_by_pos`
- `details_by_xa`
- `total_kh`
- `total_rows`
- `active_source`
- `active_source_label`
- `error`

Ham backend can nam trong `HOME_PAGE/home_page.php`:
- `normalize_date_input()`: chuan hoa ngay.
- `default_report_date_input()`: mac dinh la ngay hien tai tru 1 ngay.
- `resolve_mapos_input()`: tra ve `3400` neu bo trong.
- `resolve_source_input()`: chuan hoa `ALL/TW/DP`.
- `home_page_source_label()`: doi ma nguon sang nhan hien thi.
- `home_page_source_bind_value()`: doi `ALL` thanh `null` khi bind SQL.
- `as_number()`: ep so an toan.
- `oci_run_query()`: wrapper query Oracle.
- `build_breakdown_index()`: tao index chi tiet theo POS/Xa va chuong trinh vay.
- `build_chart_scheme_items()`: cat top chuong trinh vay cho donut chart.
- `build_home_page_data()`: ham tong hop chinh, ghep du lieu tat ca panel.

Ham SQL can nam trong `HOME_PAGE/home_page_sql.php`:
- `home_page_source_case_sql()`: xac dinh nguon von `TW/DP`.
- `home_page_base_sql_core()`: query nen cua dashboard.
- `home_page_detail_grouped_sql_core()`: group tong hop theo POS/Xa.
- `home_page_detail_sql()`: query chi tiet tong hop.
- `home_page_scheme_breakdown_grouped_core()`: group theo chuong trinh vay.
- `home_page_scheme_breakdown_sql()`: query chi tiet chuong trinh vay.
- `home_page_totals_sql()`: tong hop KPI toan trang.
- `home_page_source_totals_sql()`: tong du no theo nguon von.
- `home_page_top_scheme_sql()`: top chuong trinh vay theo du no.
- `dm_pos_sql()`: helper POS.

Ham frontend noi bat:
- `fmt()`: dinh dang so.
- `normalizeSource()`: chuan hoa `ALL/TW/DP`.
- `renderSourceToolbar()`: cap nhat toolbar nguon von.
- `polarToCartesian()` va `describeDonutSlice()`: ve donut chart SVG.
- `renderSchemeChart()`: render bieu do chuong trinh vay.
- `renderSummaryList()`: render danh sach POS/Xa.
- `renderDetailRows()`: render bang trong modal chi tiet.
- `openDetail()` / `closeDetail()`: mo/dong modal chi tiet.
- `bindListEvents()`: gan su kien click cho POS/Xa.
- `setSource()`: doi bo loc nguon von.
- `fetchData()`: goi API va cap nhat toan bo giao dien.

### 4.5. Module USER-SYSTEM (`USER-SYSTEM/user_system.php`, `USER-SYSTEM/layout_insert.php`, `USER-SYSTEM/user_system_sql.php`)

Muc dich:
- Quan ly can bo tren database `qlcv`.
- Loc danh sach theo tu khoa va phong ban.
- Xem chi tiet 1 can bo.
- Them moi can bo.
- Cap nhat can bo.
- Hien flash message sau khi luu.

Tinh nang nguoi dung:
- Tim kiem theo ma can bo, ho ten, phong ban, chuc vu, email.
- Loc theo phong ban bang combobox.
- Phan trang danh sach.
- Loc nhanh trong bang hien tai.
- Mo chi tiet can bo ben panel phai.
- Cap nhat can bo co hoac khong doi mat khau.
- Them moi can bo qua trang rieng `layout_insert.php`.
- Xac nhan truoc khi ghi du lieu.
- Giu nguyen bo loc va trang sau khi cap nhat.

DB va bang du lieu:
- Ket noi uu tien vao database `qlcv`.
- Bang chinh:
  - `canbo`
  - `phongban`
  - `CHUCVU`

API/backend action:
- `?api=detail&id=...`
  Tra JSON chi tiet 1 can bo.
- `?api=list`
  Tra JSON danh sach can bo da loc.
- `POST action=save`
  Xu ly them moi hoac cap nhat.

Co che quan trong:
- Khi vao module, he thong mo ket noi rieng den DB `qlcv`.
- Goi `db_allow_protected_host_writes()` de cho phep thao tac ghi tren host bao ve.
- `return_url`, `return_keyword`, `return_filter_maphong`, `return_page` giup redirect ve dung man hinh sau khi luu.
- `confirm_write` bat buoc bang `1` moi duoc ghi.
- Truong `giaoviec` luon duoc dat `NULL`.
- Neu them moi, mat khau bat buoc va duoc ma hoa qua `PASSWORD(...)`.

Ham backend can nam trong `USER-SYSTEM/user_system.php`:
- `json_exit()`: tra JSON.
- `normalize_text()`: chuan hoa text dau vao.
- `user_system_resolve_return_url()`: validate URL quay lai.
- `user_system_redirect()`: redirect an toan kem query.
- `user_system_row_matches()`: loc danh sach theo keyword.
- `user_system_row_matches_department()`: loc theo phong ban.
- `db_fetch_assoc_rows()`: helper doc nhieu dong tu MySQL.
- `db_fetch_one_assoc()`: helper doc 1 dong.
- `user_system_flash_set()`: set flash message.
- `user_system_flash_take()`: lay va xoa flash.
- `user_system_text()`: escape HTML.
- `user_system_option_exists()`: kiem tra option ton tai trong danh sach.

Ham backend can nam trong `USER-SYSTEM/layout_insert.php`:
- `layout_insert_normalize_text()`: chuan hoa text dau vao.
- `layout_insert_text()`: escape HTML.
- `layout_insert_flash_take()`: lay flash cho man hinh them moi.
- `layout_insert_db_fetch_assoc_rows()`: helper doc danh muc phong ban/chuc vu.

Ham SQL can nam trong `USER-SYSTEM/user_system_sql.php`:
- `user_system_list_sql()`: danh sach can bo.
- `user_system_count_sql()`: dem tong can bo.
- `user_system_detail_sql()`: chi tiet 1 can bo.
- `user_system_insert_sql()`: insert can bo moi.
- `user_system_update_sql()`: update can bo, co/khong co doi mat khau.
- `user_system_role_sql()`: danh sach role.
- `user_system_department_sql()`: danh sach phong ban.
- `user_system_posotion_sql()`: danh sach chuc vu.

Ham frontend noi bat:
- `trimValue()`: chuan hoa input trong form chinh sua.
- `isUpdateMode()`: nhan dien dang them moi hay cap nhat.
- `promptSave()`: hop thoai xac nhan ghi.
- Quick filter trong bang danh sach de loc client-side.
- Form `layout_insert.php` cung co xac nhan truoc khi them moi.

### 4.6. Lop ket noi DB (`DB/connect_DB.php`)

Vai tro:
- Doc cau hinh tu bien moi truong.
- Ket noi MySQL nguon va local.
- Ket noi Oracle.
- Ghi nho loi ket noi gan nhat.
- Chan lenh ghi vao host nhay cam neu chua cap phep.

Host mac dinh dang duoc code san:
- MySQL source: `10.64.0.251:3306`, DB `dngws`
- MySQL local: `127.0.0.1:3307`, DB `dashboard_my`
- Oracle: `10.64.0.56:1521`, service `IMSREPORT`

Guard host bao ve:
- `10.64.0.251`
- `10.64.0.56`

Ham backend can nam:
- `env_or_default()`: doc ENV dang chuoi.
- `env_int_or_default()`: doc ENV dang so nguyen.
- `connect_mysql()`: mo MySQL co chon DB.
- `connect_mysql_without_db()`: mo MySQL chua chon DB.
- `db_last_mysql_connect_error()`: lay loi MySQL gan nhat.
- `db_last_oracle_connect_error()`: lay loi Oracle gan nhat.
- `db_is_protected_host()`: kiem tra host bao ve.
- `db_strip_sql_comments()`: bo comment SQL.
- `db_is_write_sql()`: phat hien SQL ghi.
- `db_allow_protected_host_writes()`: cap quyen ghi cho host bao ve.
- `db_is_protected_host_write_allowed()`: kiem tra da cap quyen ghi chua.
- `db_should_block_sql()`: quyet dinh chan SQL.
- `db_mysqli_prepare()`: wrapper prepare MySQL co guard.
- `db_mysqli_query()`: wrapper query MySQL co guard.
- `db_oci_parse()`: wrapper parse Oracle co guard.
- `connect_oracle()`: mo Oracle, thu nhieu DSN va retry mot so loi listener.
- `db_is_host_reachable()`: test host/port bang `fsockopen`.

Bien quan trong sau khi load:
- `$conn`
- `$mysqlActiveHost`
- `$oracle_conn`
- `$sourceHost`, `$localHost`, `$oracleHost`

### 4.7. Thu muc Oracle ho tro (`CODE-ORCALE_SQL`)

Vai tro:
- Chua script nghiep vu Oracle doc lap ngoai cac module web.
- Phuc vu nghiep vu KT740 va cac phan tich Oracle.

Noi dung chinh:
- `CODE.SQL`
  Chua thu tuc `INTELLECT.PROC_DN_KT740_TH`.
  Thu tuc nay:
  - Nhan `P_MAPOS`, `P_NGAYBC`.
  - Kiem tra ngay HSTDCT va kha nang nhan du lieu.
  - Xoa du lieu tam `DN_DATA_TEMP` cho key `DN_KT740_TH`.
  - Lap theo tung POS va tung chi tieu `DN_KT740_TH`.
  - Dung dynamic SQL de insert ket qua vao `DN_DATA_TEMP`.
  - Mo `SYS_REFCURSOR` tra ve ket qua cuoi theo `CODE`, `MAXA`, `MAPOS`, `CHITIEU`, `DEP`, `SOLIEU`.
  - Co `EXCEPTION` gom `SQLERRM`, `CODE`, `POS`.
- `KT740.txt`
  Truy van mau lien quan du lieu CASA 105, mapping xa, to tiet kiem va diem giao dich.
- `README_ENCODING.md`
  Nhac quy tac encoding UTF-8.

Luu y:
- Thu muc nay la nghiep vu Oracle doc lap, khong duoc web goi truc tiep tu `index.php`.
- Tuy nhien no la mot phan cua project va can duoc xem nhu tai lieu/nghiep vu backend bo sung.

### 4.8. Lop giao dien CSS (`view/*.php`)

Vai tro:
- Moi file tra ve `Content-Type: text/css; charset=UTF-8`.
- Dung PHP lam endpoint CSS de tach style theo module.

File chinh:
- `view/style_Das.php`
  Style cho shell dashboard chinh, sidebar, iframe, placeholder, badge.
- `view/Styple_vb_iot.php`
  Style cho:
  - trang danh sach VB_IOT (`page=index`)
  - trang xem van ban inline (`page=view`)
- `view/Style_dgx.php`
  Style cho danh sach DGX va cac popup bao cao.
- `view/Style_home_page.php`
  Style cho dashboard du no, cards, chart, modal chi tiet.
- `view/Style_user_system.php`
  Style cho USER-SYSTEM, form, table, hero, stat card.

## 5. Routing, rewrite va entrypoint

- `index.html`
  Redirect client-side sang `index.php`, giu nguyen query string.

- `.htaccess`
  Co 2 rewrite quan trong:
  - `file/<id>/<ten>.pdf` -> `VB_IOT/view_file.php?id=<id>&raw=1`
  - `index.html` -> `index.php`

Dieu nay cho phep:
- Xem PDF inline bang URL dep.
- Truy cap `index.html` nhung van chay vao shell PHP chinh.

## 6. Phu thuoc va dieu kien van hanh

Phu thuoc:
- PHP + XAMPP.
- MySQLi.
- OCI8 de ket noi Oracle.
- `phpoffice/phpspreadsheet` de xuat Excel.

Composer:
- `composer.json` hien tai chi khai bao:
  - `phpoffice/phpspreadsheet`

Dieu kien can de project chay day du:
- Co the ket noi MySQL nguon hoac fallback sang local MySQL.
- Co OCI8 va ket noi Oracle neu muon dung `DGX` va `HOME_PAGE`.
- Co Apache rewrite de URL `/dashboard/file/...` hoat dong dung.

