## 8. Cac file khong phai logic nghiep vu chinh

- `composer-setup.php`
  File cai dat Composer, khong thuoc logic dashboard.
- `composer.phar`
  Binary Composer.
- `vendor/`
  Thu vien ben thu ba.
- `VB_IOT/vb_iot_tmp_backup.php`
  Ban backup cua module VB_IOT.
- `USER-SYSTEM/user_system.php.bak-20260323-vi`
  Ban backup cua USER-SYSTEM.

## 9. Ket luan nhanh

Project nay thuc chat la mot bo dashboard PHP chia thanh 4 module nghiep vu ro rang:
- 1 module quan ly van ban va luu tru local.
- 1 module bao cao DGX va xuat Excel.
- 1 module dashboard du no dung Oracle.
- 1 module quan ly can bo tren DB `qlcv`.

Neu can doc code de bao tri, cac file can uu tien nam dau tien la:
- `index.php`
- `DB/connect_DB.php`
- `VB_IOT/vb_iot.php`
- `DGX/dgx.php`
- `HOME_PAGE/home_page.php`
- `USER-SYSTEM/user_system.php`

Neu can sua truy van, xem cac file:
- `VB_IOT/vb_iot_sql.php`
- `DGX/dgx_sql.php`
- `HOME_PAGE/home_page_sql.php`
- `USER-SYSTEM/user_system_sql.php`

Neu can sua giao dien, xem:
- `view/style_Das.php`
- `view/Styple_vb_iot.php`
- `view/Style_dgx.php`
- `view/Style_home_page.php`
- `view/Style_user_system.php`
